        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>BARSABAS</strong> son of Saba, the surname (1) of Joseph, also called Justus (Acts 1:23), some identify him with Barnabas; (2) of Judas, who was a “prophet.” Nothing more is known of him than what is mentioned in Acts 15:32. <em>[Reviewer: condense Easton's entry as needed.]</em>",
